    "title": "Thomas County Central football set to host semifinal - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alison Posey ,\n3 hours ago TALLAHASSEE, Fla. (WCTV) - Back in January, the Thomas County Central football team met and redefined their goals for the upcoming season. They branded the motto “Whatever it Takes.” Now, eleven months later, the Jackets are exactly where they want to. They’re undefeated and playing in the state semifinals at home with a chance to play for a state title next week in the Benz. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
